  "description": "Imperial Capital, 1930.<br>\nA strange group of people carrying musical instrument cases landed on Tokyo station.<br>\nThey are called the “Jaegers”, who came to hunt vampires.<br>\nAmongst them, there stood a young man with striking serenity and unusual aura.<br>\nHis name is Yuliy, a werewolf whose home village was destroyed by vampires.<br>\nYuliy and the Jaegers engage in deadly battle over a mysterious holy arc only known as “The Arc of Sirius”.<br>\nWhat truth awaits them at the end…?<br>\nWith eternal affinity and spiral of conspiracy entwine, the highly anticipated action-thriller anime begins!<br><br>\n\n(Source: Official Website)",
